      "normalizedSource": "To enable the surroundings to occlude an entity, you can set the [`preferredBlendingMode`](environmentblendingcomponent/preferredblendingmode.md) to [`occluded(by:)`](environmentblendingcomponent/blendingmode/occluded(by:).md), specifying the environment type as [`EnvironmentBlendingComponent.EnvironmentType.surroundings`](environmentblendingcomponent/environmenttype/surroundings.md):",
